&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Quantitative Risk Quant who can both design risk models and ship production-quality tools; such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;scenario and stress-testing capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;factor based risk decomposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
