&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will identify and source new datasets by building and maintaining relationships with sell-side banks and data providers, attending industry events and conferences, and conducting in-depth research across data exchanges, industry publications, and sell-side materials. The successful candidate will partner closely with researchers and portfolio managers to understand their data needs and requirements, and will work cross-functionally with data providers, legal, compliance, data engineering and research management to support the full data lifecycle, including procurement, onboarding, renewals and decommissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A compelling candidate will also have a strong background in data strategy, including assessing the data landscape, identifying the most attractive opportunities for the firm, and developing both short- and long-term plans to capture them. Finally, this person will also help improve our data operating model by identifying creative ways to apply new data across the firm and by automating data workflows using AI-based approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
