&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To provide execution and order placement services to Man&#39;s investment engines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regulatory and legal framework&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be aware of and act in accordance with the regulatory and legal framework governing the trader&#39;s activities, including any relevant market abuse rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To the extent applicable, understand and abide by relevant market risk limits and thresholds and prudential levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Policies and Procedures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know, understand and comply with Man&#39;s Global Compliance policies and any internal procedures relevant to the trader&#39;s business activities and with the requirements set out in Man&#39;s Staff Handbook and Global Code of Ethics as well as any global, regional and local compliance manuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain appropriate authorisation to trade pursuant to the PM&#39;s recorded instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report regularly to their appointed line manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At the end of each day, ensure that all transactions for which the trader is responsible for executing, have been recorded in the trading system correctly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report any potential regulatory concerns to Compliance and to the appointed line manager. This includes any market activity of a suspicious nature as well as known or suspected breaches of regulation, exchange rules or firm policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Best Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to improve process to ensure Man meets its Best Execution obligations for Man&#39;s clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximise alpha retention post investment decision through: - Robust framework for continuous evaluation and improvement of the execution process to minimise slippage and explicit trading costs - Application of quantitative methods combined with trading experience to decide and discuss with the PM, the optimal execution strategy to best match the PM’s trading and investment objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Trading Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trading technology to improve execution toolkit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace technology to help automate workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive development of our trading platform, infrastructure and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative and quantitative analysis to improve performance of our systematic and discretionary strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a strong understanding of Technology and a forward-thinking mindset, staying ahead of emerging developments and their practical applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate to advanced understanding of AI models and the ability to integrate AI-driven practices into trading desk workflows to drive meaningful optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Broker Execution Evaluation/Review&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversight of broker roster and ensuring proper allocation of flow keeping in mind metrics of broker performance, coverage model, execution research and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback to executing brokers of areas of improvement, ranking etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prime Broker relationship management, to maintain and optimise said relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaison with operations teams to ensure no disruption or backlog with the brokers resulting in process bottlenecks leading to missed opportunities on the execution front in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Workflow Considerations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to raise/cancel an order ticket, based on the PM’s recorded instructions, if required (this should not be viewed as standard practise)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to be able to view PM’s holdings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Middle Office to ensure timely matching of trades&lt;/li&gt;
