2ff30f623cb6eded36e91641c11c462709d6099b:
&lt;p&gt;Flow Traders is looking for a new Senior Operations Specialist to join our Operations department. This is a unique opportunity to join a leading proprietary trading firm with an entrepreneurial and innovative culture at the heart of its business.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Flow Traders EMEA Operations team based in our Amsterdam office. We have an expanding product universe, covering all major asset classes. Our team covers a multitude of areas and follows the full trade lifecycle. As such, the opportunities to learn and grow are limitless within the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, we are looking for candidates with 5+ years of relevant experience in Operations, Middle Office, or a related field, combined with good analytical and programing skills, as well as a a strong desire to continue learning and developing within this space. If you are interested in the role and believe your experience aligns, we encourage you to apply and include a short explanation of your motivation to join Flow Traders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile trades and positions intraday and next day, across multiple asset classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calculate daily P&amp;amp;L and cash - own the numbers, find the breaks, explain them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the full trade lifecycle cold: execution, settlement, fees, interest bookings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dig into large datasets to find what&#39;s wrong and fix how the process works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with Prime Brokers, trading desks, risk, compliance, and finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate the manual stuff - write the script, don&#39;t just flag the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in trading operations, middle office, or financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Finance, Economics, Mathematics, or something similarly quantitative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python and SQL are hard requirements - you write code, not just read it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp attention to detail and a genuine appetite for getting into the weeds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to trading, front office, or technology teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling large, messy datasets and knowing when the numbers don&#39;t add up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You reach for a script before you reach for a spreadsheet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
