&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and SQL skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience applying LLMs and modern AI tooling to analytical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Bloomberg or comparable market-data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal, with full professional fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and a track record of delivering results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter, comfortable operating with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
