&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Before market opens, check that all required data and related processes are ready for the trading day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;During the trading day, perform ad-hoc analysis on topics linked with current trade opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on various long-term projects to build market-leading analytical models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
