&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one of Python, C++, or KDB+/q&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in, or knowledge of finance and the global markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Ability to work effectively with AI tools and systems, including demonstrable experience using them collaboratively to enhance software development, data analysis, or research workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with git and Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to continuously learn new technologies and develop with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
