&lt;li&gt;Bachelors degree or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possessing exceptional organizational skills with an acute attention to detail, coupled with the ability to prioritize and manage multiple projects concurrently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to collaborate with teammates globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with MS Office tools and other relevant software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show readiness to hit the ground running, learn existing processes, and contribute to the growth of the L&amp;amp;D function through the successful completion of assigned projects.&lt;/li&gt;
