581fb630130622b41a8c633bc53e8b341445501a:
&lt;h4&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;The primary focus of this role will be on OTC Derivatives Middle Office operations, with responsibilities encompassing derivative trade capture, trade confirmations, settlements, reconciliations, and position life-cycle events within the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Manage all aspects of OTC Derivative trade validation, maintenance, affirmation, settlement, and reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Validate, process, and settle all periodic events to ensure the integrity of the entire trade life cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Perform position and cash reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Perform trade affirmation in MarkitWire with counterparties to minimize risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Monitor T+0 trade capture exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Process corporate actions for APAC and EMEA regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;5–7 years of experience in an OTC Middle/Back-Office role, covering trade processing, collateral, confirmations, settlements, cash, position, and trade reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Demonstrated proficiency across all types of OTC products, including equity swaps, credit default swaps, variance swaps, options, asset swaps, interest rate swaps, forwards, MBS, FX settlements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Proven ability to assess the impact of corporate actions on P&amp;amp;L and start-of-day (SOD) processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in all calculations required to support products within the applicable asset class coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Ability to establish and maintain strong organizational relationships that foster a productive and collaborative work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience working on system and process improvements, as well as new business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Proficiency in relevant applications, including Excel, MarkitWire, CTM, Traiana, NYFIX, and Bloomberg, as required to excel in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

