e48f57a0770fb654226566c0871e90d3b268f03f:
&lt;p&gt;Jump Trading Group is committed to world class research. We empower exceptional talents in Mathematics, Physics, and Computer Science to seek scientific boundaries, push through them, and apply cutting edge research to global financial markets. Our culture is unique. Constant innovation requires fearlessness, creativity, intellectual honesty, and a relentless competitive streak. We believe in winning together and unlocking unique individual talent by incenting collaboration and mutual respect. At Jump, research outcomes drive more than superior risk adjusted returns. We design, develop, and deploy technologies that change our world, fund start-ups across industries, and partner with leading global research organizations and universities to solve problems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;seeking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;highly organized and detail-oriented individual to join our team as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;HR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;Operations Specialist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;supporting a seamless employee lifecycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and contributing to various HR projects. This role provides exposure to key HR functions, including benefits, payroll, compensation, immigration, global mobility, HRIS, and employee relations. The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;HR Operations Specialist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams like talent acquisition, talent development, legal, compliance, and business leaders, as well as with external vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW26951276 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End APAC Payroll Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage ongoing payroll operations across APAC in partnership with external vendors, ensuring accuracy, timeliness, compliance, and continuous process improvement to support an efficient employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits Administration:&lt;/strong&gt; Support benefits administration across APAC, including employee queries, enrollments and changes, coordination with brokers and vendors, and annual renewals, while maintaining accurate records and a positive employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HRIS Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage HRIS transactions and employee data in Workday, ensuring accurate lifecycle processing, strong data integrity, effective downstream payroll support, and continuous improvement of HR processes and data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the global people operations team to continuously improve the full employee lifecycle, managing key processes such as contract renewals, reference checks, VOE issuance, and support for Shanghai Hukou applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity &amp;amp; Audits:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct HR data audits, maintain physical personnel files (P-files), respond to general HR inquiries, and validate employee data within Workday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Update regional employee handbooks on the Company Intranet (Confluence) as policies evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance Research: &lt;/strong&gt;Research and ensure compliance with employment and benefits laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confidentiality: &lt;/strong&gt;Protect company information by maintaining strict confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take entrepreneurship to identify opportunities where we can do things differently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned or needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You’ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field with a strong academic record and at least 3 years in HR operations, payroll, benefits, or a related area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HRIS Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with HR systems like Workday, Ultimate Software, PeopleSoft, or Greenhouse.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits Knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Understanding of benefit plan principles and relevant laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excel Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced Excel skills, including pivot tables and V-lookups.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong focus on accuracy and the ability to prioritize tasks effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-Savvy &amp;amp; Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; Interest in workflow automation and a proactive approach to technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in process improvement and project management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Creative problem-solver with resilience to change, able to adapt to ad hoc situations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Effective verbal and written communication skills, with experience working with various management levels and functions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Motivated &amp;amp; Independent: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment, managing multiple projects with minimal supervision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth-Oriented Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter with intellectual curiosity, a desire to learn broadly across HR operations, and a willingness to gain diverse experiences within people operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Spirit: &lt;/strong&gt;A healthy sense of humor and enthusiasm for working collaboratively within the People Operations team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and predictable availability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
