72f4e0937bad08f8a6ea320ac3df5a22f3123fb4:
&lt;p&gt;Flow Traders is looking for a highly organized and proactive&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Team Assistant&lt;/strong&gt; to support the Executive Assistant to the CEO and the broader CEO Office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for ensuring the smooth day-to-day coordination of administrative and operational activities, enabling the CEO Office to operate efficiently in a fast-paced, global trading environment. You will play a key supporting role in managing schedules, logistics, and communications, while maintaining the highest standards of professionalism, accuracy, and discretion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is ideal for someone who thrives in a dynamic environment, is detail-oriented, and enjoys being a reliable and trusted support partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you will do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administrative &amp;amp; Operational Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Provide day-to-day administrative support to the Executive Assistant to the CEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Manage calendars, meetings, and scheduling across multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Organise meeting logistics, including room bookings, catering, and travel arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Prepare meeting materials, agendas, and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Act as a point of contact for internal stakeholders on behalf of the CEO Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Support cross-regional coordination and ensure timely follow-up on action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Coordinate all travel arrangements including flights, accommodation, and itineraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Prepare travel briefings and documentation, and proactively handle any changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events, Projects &amp;amp; Administration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Support the planning of internal events, leadership meetings, offsites, and board-related logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Process expenses, invoices, and approvals accurately and in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Maintain organised records and ensure compliance with internal policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Contribute to ad hoc projects and process improvements within the CEO Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you need to succeed&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of experience in an administrative or support role (e.g. Team Assistant, Office Manager, PA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and manage multiple tasks in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of professionalism and discretion when handling sensitive information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset and willingness to take ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong MS Office / Microsoft 365 skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in and confidence using AI tools (e.g. Microsoft Copilot) to work more efficiently and support day-to-day coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in office 5 days per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we offer&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flow Traders, we create the conditions for hard‑working, high‑performing people to do their best work. From a thorough onboarding and ongoing access to Flow Academy, to latest technology and a collaborative, non‑hierarchical culture, we give you the tools, ownership, and support to move fast and drive outcomes. We keep a close‑knit, small‑company feel while offering competitive salary, annual discretionary profit share, and comprehensive benefits,&amp;nbsp;so talent can grow here, and stay here.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;See our benefits below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flow Academy and opportunities to attend domain-related conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunch, great coffee, and a fully stocked kitchen and snack bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house Bar and Lounge with arcade, table tennis, billiards, and game consoles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company boat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house gym and sessions with our nutritionist or personal trainer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-weekly massages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company trip and a variety of events throughout the year, such as the New Years Event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global rotations across our offices worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
