&lt;p&gt;Job description:&lt;br&gt;Jump Trading Group is committed to world class research. We empower exceptional talents in Mathematics, Physics, and Computer Science to seek scientific boundaries, push through them, and apply cutting edge research to global financial markets. Our culture is unique. Constant innovation requires fearlessness, creativity, intellectual honesty, and a relentless competitive streak. We believe in winning together and unlocking unique individual talent by incentivizing collaboration and mutual respect. At Jump, research outcomes drive more than superior risk adjusted returns. We design, develop, and deploy technologies that change our world, fund start-ups across industries, and partner with leading global research organizations and universities to solve problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jump Trading has a global team of technologists who architect, build and maintain our world-class trading platform. From optimizing our core trading engine to building custom hardware, we leverage software &amp;amp; hardware engineering, data science and research, to deliver the infrastructure and tools that drive our trading and business needs.&lt;br&gt;This role is in the Realtime Apps team where they build world class trading tools to empower trading teams to visualise and trade in markets all around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will build the next generation of high‐performance, data‐dense GUI applications that deliver real‐time market data to traders. These applications are the primary interface between users and our trading systems, with a strong focus on tick‐to‐screen latency, performance, and visual clarity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will focus on low‐level rendering, graphics pipelines, and efficient data delivery to the browser, leveraging modern web technologies to push the limits of what is possible in real‐time GUIs. As a senior engineer, you will help shape technical direction, mentor teammates, and establish best practices for building world‐class GUI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Need:&lt;br&gt;· 5+ years of experience building high‐performance GUI applications&lt;br&gt;· Strong experience with React and modern web application architecture&lt;br&gt;· Deep understanding of low‐level rendering pipelines and rendering techniques&lt;br&gt;· Hands‐on experience with WebAssembly (WASM), Web APIs, WebGPU, WebGL, or equivalent graphics technologies&lt;br&gt;· Experience building real‐time, data‐intensive web applications&lt;br&gt;· Solid full‐stack fundamentals and the ability to work across frontend and backend boundaries&lt;br&gt;· Strong focus on performance, memory usage, and responsiveness under heavy data loads&lt;br&gt;· Ability to write clean, testable code and provide constructive code reviews&lt;br&gt;· Desire to take technical ownership, influence architecture, and mentor other engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;br&gt;· Experience optimizing rendering pipelines for large, frequently updating datasets&lt;br&gt;· Familiarity with browser internals and performance profiling tools&lt;br&gt;· Experience with Rust or C++&lt;br&gt;· Background in trading, finance, or other real‐time data‐driven domains&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D Insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Voluntary Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid vacation plus paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wellness Programs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

1554288f0870ace74c8a33de3dffdc7ef2f64777:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;Jump Trading Group is committed to world class research. We empower exceptional talents in Mathematics, Physics, and Computer Science to seek scientific boundaries, push through them, and apply cutting edge research to global financial markets. Our culture is unique. Constant innovation requires fearlessness, creativity, intellectual honesty, and a relentless competitive streak. We believe in winning together and unlocking unique individual talent by incenting collaboration and mutual respect. At Jump, research outcomes drive more than superior risk adjusted returns. We design, develop, and deploy technologies that change our world, fund start-ups across industries, and partner with leading global research organizations and universities to solve problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jump Trading has a global team of technologists who architect, build and maintain our world-class trading platform. From optimizing our core trading engine to building custom hardware, we leverage software &amp;amp; hardware engineering, sophisticated front-end technologies, data science and research, to deliver the infrastructure and tools that drive our trading and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced UI front-end developer to join our UI platform team.&amp;nbsp; We operate in a fast-paced, highly collaborative, agile environment with an emphasis on pair-programming, testing and good process to help us produce high-quality code and applications very efficiently.&amp;nbsp; Our focus is on delivering business value to the firm: we aim for simplicity wherever possible but build cutting-edge UIs when the business need is clear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be expected to build and extend our core UI platform, use the platform to build business-critical applications, and work with a wide variety of teams to help them use the platform to build their own applications.&amp;nbsp; You should be very comfortable with the ecosystem of tools &amp;amp; techniques within the modern web development environment, and you should have a deep passion for enabling other developers to be more productive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4+ years of professional experience building web-based UIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with React, TypeScript, WebSocket protocols, REST, and UI unit-testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very comfortable working in a highly agile, collaborative methodology (sprints, pair-programming, testing, estimation, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep empathy for developers who will consume your platform and foresight to deliver improvements while also managing change carefully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and predictable availability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An eye for quality design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes, Helm, containers, CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in trading / finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you are currently a student or recent&amp;nbsp;graduate, please see our Campus postings which offer both intern and full-time opportunities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D Insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Voluntary Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid vacation plus paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wellness Programs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

aeab63608629daeb4d555aa61d169307c3b8fd74:
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is a leading quantitative trading firm founded in 1998. Tower has built its business on a high-performance platform and independent trading teams. We have a 25+ year track record of innovation and a reputation for discovering unique market opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower is home to some of the world’s best systematic trading and engineering talent. We empower portfolio managers to build their teams and strategies independently while providing the economies of scale that come from a large, global organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineers thrive at Tower while developing electronic trading infrastructure at a world class level. Our engineers solve challenging problems in the realms of low-latency programming, FPGA technology, hardware acceleration and machine learning. Our ongoing investment in top engineering talent and technology ensures our platform remains unmatched in terms of functionality, scalability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, every employee plays a role in our success. Our Business Support teams are essential to building and maintaining the platform that powers everything we do — combining market access, data, compute, and research infrastructure with risk management, compliance, and a full suite of business services. Our Business Support teams enable our trading and engineering teams to perform at their best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, employees will find a stimulating, results-oriented environment where highly intelligent and motivated colleagues inspire each other to reach their greatest potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and implementing automated systems (Python/Bash) to identify known security exposures and Engineering security infrastructure to optimize efficiency, expand capabilities, meet client requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting security infrastructure and act as an escalation point for the firm in troubleshooting/supporting any issues. (Hashicorp vault / IAM / SIEM / EDR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting on discovered security flaws, how to exploit them, and how to remediate flaws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in attack simulation exercises on a periodic basis, contribute to threat and vulnerability management and conduct continuous assessment around the effectiveness of defense response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring adherence to appropriate standards, best practices, workplace policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working effectively as a team member, providing hands-on support to clients, maintaining communication and updating senior staff on progress and participate in Incident Response procedures if/when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years of relevant experience, successfully delivering in an Enterprise environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor/Masters of Engineering in Computer Science / Information Security / Cyber Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Unix/Linux environments with strong command-line and shell knowledge, along with scripting/development capability in Python/Bash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the intelligence lifecycle and frameworks such as the Cyber Kill Chain and MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cyber threats in the financial sector, with a thorough understanding of DeFi and Blockchain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SIEM technologies, threat hunting, monitoring, investigations, and strong analytical, writing, and documentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor and guide security analysts in cyber threat intelligence skills, work with minimal guidance, and familiarity with tools like JIRA and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of network and security tools, including IDS/IPS, NAC, DLP, VPN, firewall management and audit, endpoint security, anti-malware, and database audit/monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in secure architecture design and security implementations across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security expertise in areas such as Python, Bash, C/C++, reverse engineering, wireless networks, web vulnerabilities (SQLi, XSS, CSRF), and exploit development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security applications for logging, packet capture, email, directory services, authentication, remote access, encryption, and cloud security deployment and controls (database security is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, critical thinking, and communication skills, with the ability to work under pressure, collaborate with distributed teams, and adapt to different time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven mindset with a passion for learning, along with the ability to mentor and train team members while handling complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Savings plans and other financial wellness tools available in each region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast, lunch, and snacks daily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office wellness experiences and reimbursement for select wellness expenses (e.g., gym, personal training and more)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-sponsored sports teams and fitness events (JPM Corporate Challenge, Cycle for Survival, Wall Street Rides FAR and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteer opportunities and charitable giving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, happy hours, treats, and celebrations throughout the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workshops and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance and enjoyment. No unnecessary hierarchy. No ego. Just great people doing great work – together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/p&gt;

9d219d1c3074b2cde21ac379b86b77331241e3f7:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $228.7 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 31 March 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Man Group, we run large Python research compute clusters. We have a long history of pioneering technology in finance, and this role presents the opportunity to join us, as we work towards building scalable compute for research and software development to help identify and execute on investment opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-performing Senior Python Platform Engineer to build solutions that make use of the latest capabilities in compute infrastructure. This role is at the intersection of technology and finance, helping to deliver high-impact, novel solutions that touch every part of our business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in our Developer Platform team, you will build the core research platform and infrastructure used across Man Group. You will also partner with teams across the business to create APIs and frameworks that allow researchers and developers to augment, automate and transform our investment and operational workflows. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, build and maintenance of Man’s core Python compute platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders in research, trading and technology, to design and build open-source cluster-compute technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be aware of and actively monitor the latest developments in applied cluster compute, particularly Python facing libraries and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement novel solutions - we take the best of what the open-source world has to offer and make it fit our needs, often contributing back to upstream projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with teams across the business to promote understanding and adoption of our compute cluster capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Python, with extensive professional experience in building production applications and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of modern cluster compute - Kubernetes, Spark, Hadoop Yarn, Ray, Airflow are some of the technologies we use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading work in a formal software development environment alongside other engineers in a collaborative manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building platforms on the Linux Operating System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-organised with the ability to effectively manage time across multiple projects with competing business demands and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with the ability to establish and maintain a close working relationship with quantitative developers, researchers, and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantageous&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Academic record including a degree with high mathematical / computing content, or equivalent commercial experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GPU and CPU optimization technologies (for example, NUMA architectures or GPU profiling techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C/C++, or other low-level or object-oriented languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building tools and technologies within systematic or discretionary investing units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with applied mathematics, financial markets and instruments, with awareness of underlying concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 1000px; height: 565px;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/z3YUoZQVCHQ?si=Mr5TZZZWjNlFwnEb&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; height=&quot;565&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

4616787396b0ee7a356de46a1e42178d7a2ec9c0:
&lt;p&gt;Jump Trading Group is committed to world class research. We empower exceptional talents in Mathematics, Physics, and Computer Science to seek scientific boundaries, push through them, and apply cutting edge research to global financial markets. Our culture is unique. Constant innovation requires fearlessness, creativity, intellectual honesty, and a relentless competitive streak. We believe in winning together and unlocking unique individual talent by incenting collaboration and mutual respect. At Jump, research outcomes drive more than superior risk adjusted returns. We design, develop, and deploy technologies that change our world, fund start-ups across industries, and partner with leading global research organizations and universities to solve problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an enthusiastic, detail-oriented professional to join our People Ops Team as a Leadership &amp;amp; Professional Development Coordinator. You will coordinate and deliver world-class learning experiences for Jump employees while driving operational excellence through process improvements and AI-enabled efficiency. This role is US-based but includes global coordination for EMEA regions, supporting remote program planning, vendor contracts, and logistics that don&#39;t require on-the-ground presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Jump’s Leadership and Professional Development function continues to evolve, this role offers future growth opportunities to expand scope and impact into LMS ownership, program design, learning strategy, and new hire onboarding, all from a global perspective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate learning programs end-to-end:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage firmwide onboarding programs, leadership and professional development programs, and technical training coordination, including scheduling, participant communications, materials preparation, venue management, and completion tracking across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the firm&#39;s Learning Management System (LMS) to streamline enrollment, rosters, reporting, and the overall learner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global vendor management and budget tracking, including contracts, invoices, and spend monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support EMEA program coordination remotely, partnering with regional stakeholders across time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams (HRBPs, business leads) and external vendors (coaches, facilitators) to ensure high-quality learning outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Speaker Series program, including scheduling guest speakers, managing logistics, and ensuring seamless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the point of contact during live, virtual, and hybrid programs, troubleshooting in real-time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive efficiency and continuous improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process improvements, including streamlining workflows, automating tasks, and creating reusable templates that reduce manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools (Claude, Cowork) to accelerate operations, including content curation, communications, data analysis, and workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the program feedback process to identify trends, areas of success, and areas of opportunity for future initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain L&amp;amp;D governance frameworks, documentation, and reporting on internal platforms (Confluence), establishing quality standards and on-going review practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned or needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You’ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5+ years of experience in program/project coordination, L&amp;amp;D operations, HR, or similar fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills with the ability to manage competing priorities and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven attention to detail with a focus on quality; reviews own work for accuracy, considers potential gaps, and balances speed with thoroughness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-oriented mindset with the ability to connect operational work to broader outcomes (employee experience, program effectiveness, talent retention).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication across all levels and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and comfort with data interpretation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative yet accountable; thinks strategically when executing details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a Learning Management System (LMS) preferred; comfort using AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot) a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree or equivalent relevant and practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and predictable availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Overtime eligibility&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D Insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Voluntary Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid vacation plus paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wellness Programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

b48d9da1cf3cb38d29b33c7f341f00595d2d0f28:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;Jump Trading Group is committed to world class research. We empower exceptional talents in Mathematics, Physics, and Computer Science to seek scientific boundaries, push through them, and apply cutting edge research to global financial markets. Our culture is unique. Constant innovation requires fearlessness, creativity, intellectual honesty, and a relentless competitive streak. We believe in winning together and unlocking unique individual talent by incenting collaboration and mutual respect. At Jump, research outcomes drive more than superior risk adjusted returns. We design, develop, and deploy technologies that change our world, fund start-ups across industries, and partner with leading global research organizations and universities to solve problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;Core Development is a global team of technologists who architect, build and maintain our world-class trading platform. From optimizing our core trading engine to building custom hardware, we leverage software &amp;amp; hardware engineering, data science and research, to deliver the infrastructure and tools that drive our trading and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will design, architect, and build high‑performance real‑time streaming systems that power trader‑facing GUI applications. These systems ingest, process, and distribute massive volumes of market data with extremely low latency and high reliability, forming the building blocks for the team to create high‑performance GUIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;You will work closely with trading, infrastructure, and support teams to ensure that real‑time tick‑to‑trade data is delivered accurately and efficiently from collocated trading systems to latency‑sensitive applications. As a senior member of the team, you will help set technical direction, make architectural decisions, and mentor other engineers while continuously raising the bar for performance and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Need:&lt;br&gt;· 5+ years of professional experience building production software in performance‑critical environments&lt;br&gt;· Strong experience with C++ and Rust in low‑latency, high‑throughput systems&lt;br&gt;· Proven ability to architect and implement real‑time data pipelines and streaming systems&lt;br&gt;· Experience working with distributed, high‑volume data such as market data or equivalent real‑time streaming domains&lt;br&gt;· Strong understanding of concurrency, memory management, and lock‑free or low‑contention designs&lt;br&gt;· Experience building systems for collocated or latency‑sensitive environments&lt;br&gt;· Experience operating, supporting, and debugging systems under real‑time production load&lt;br&gt;· Passion for writing reliable, readable, and testable code, and providing thoughtful code review feedback&lt;br&gt;· Eager to take ownership, guide technical direction, and mentor other engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;br&gt;· Involvement in the Rust developer community&lt;br&gt;· Experience with network programming (TCP/UDP, multicast, or similar)&lt;br&gt;· Familiarity with Linux internals and performance tuning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D Insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Voluntary Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid vacation plus paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wellness Programs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

dfd2598fd018d90cbbceff9b590378a818d5cb53:
&lt;p&gt;Tower is home to some of the world’s best systematic trading and engineering talent. We empower portfolio managers to build their teams and strategies independently while providing the economies of scale that come from a large, global organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineers thrive at Tower while developing electronic trading infrastructure at a world class level. Our engineers solve challenging problems in the realms of low-latency programming, FPGA technology, hardware acceleration and machine learning. Our ongoing investment in top engineering talent and technology ensures our platform remains unmatched in terms of functionality, scalability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, every employee plays a role in our success. Our Business Support teams are essential to building and maintaining the platform that powers everything we do — combining market access, data, compute, and research infrastructure with risk management, compliance, and a full suite of business services. Our Business Support teams enable our trading and engineering teams to perform at their best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, employees will find a stimulating, results-oriented environment where highly intelligent and motivated colleagues inspire each other to reach their greatest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading facilities management, workplace operations, and corporate services across all India offices, ensuring safe, reliable, and compliant day-to-day operations while delivering an exceptional employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing facilities infrastructure, including preventive and corrective maintenance of HVAC, electrical, UPS, plumbing, fire &amp;amp; life safety, and other MEP systems; overseeing AMCs, statutory inspections, compliance calendars, asset records, CAPEX/OPEX trackers, risk registers, and continuously improving SOPs and operational documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directing end-to-end employee transportation operations across India, including vendor management, service delivery, KPI/SLA monitoring, employee feedback, utilization analysis, and cost optimization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with facilities service providers, transportation vendors, Procurement, and Finance to lead vendor onboarding, contract negotiations, renewals, SLA governance, performance reviews, invoice validation, governance meetings, and implementation of corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing&amp;nbsp; workplace projects, including office fit-outs, renovations, relocations, and workspace reconfigurations by coordinating architects, consultants, contractors, landlords, and internal stakeholders while managing project timelines, budgets, quality, risks, and operational handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving governance, audit readiness, and stakeholder engagement by supporting internal and external audits, ensuring statutory and corporate compliance, tracking audit actions, leading business continuity and workplace resilience initiatives, monitoring operational performance through KPIs and SLAs, and providing regular reporting to Procurement, Finance, HR, IT, Security, and regional business leaders while serving as the primary point of contact for facilities operations across India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree in engineering, facilities management, architecture, business administration, or a related field; PMP, PRINCE2, IFMA, IWFM, or equivalent facilities management certifications are preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 10–15 years of experience in facilities management, corporate services, workplace operations, or corporate real estate, with experience managing multi-site corporate facilities; experience in financial services, technology, or multinational organizations is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in MEP systems, including HVAC, electrical distribution, UPS, DG, fire and life safety systems, and other critical building infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with annual maintenance contracts (AMCs), statutory compliance, preventive maintenance programs, SOP development, facilities trackers, audits, vendor invoicing, contract management, and SLA governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering office fit-outs, relocations, workplace enhancement projects, transportation management, business continuity initiatives, and CAPEX/OPEX planning and operational management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, vendor management, communication, and problem-solving skills, with the ability to drive operational excellence, compliance, and continuous improvement across workplace operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower’s headquarters are in the historic Equitable Building, right in the heart of NYC’s Financial District and our impact is global, with over a dozen offices around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, we believe work should be both challenging and enjoyable. That is why we foster a culture where smart, driven people thrive – without the egos. Our open concept workplace, casual dress code, and well-stocked kitchens reflect the value we place on a friendly, collaborative environment where everyone is respected, and great ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Savings plans and other financial wellness tools available in each region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast, lunch, and snacks daily&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office wellness experiences and reimbursement for select wellness expenses (e.g., gym, personal training and more)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-sponsored sports teams and fitness events (JPM Corporate Challenge, Cycle for Survival, Wall Street Rides FAR and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteer opportunities and charitable giving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, happy hours, treats, and celebrations throughout the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workshops and continuous learning opportunities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tower, you’ll find a collaborative and welcoming culture, a diverse team and a workplace that values both performance and enjoyment. No unnecessary hierarchy. No ego. Just great people doing great work – together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tower Research Capital is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

6299440b-a01f-4590-9e35-a78f93ceb604:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking to hire an exceptional individual to join our Legal Team at Schonfeld. You will have the opportunity to work within two of the Legal Team’s practice areas: Portfolio Management (PM onboarding/offboarding/counseling) and Capital Development &amp;amp; Investor Relations. This is a dynamic opportunity to partner with senior management and to blend your legal acumen with your desire to get closer to the business while addressing a wide variety of legal issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary focus will be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting, negotiating and interpreting various contracts directly with our portfolio managers (most commonly, investment management agreements, employment agreements and deeds), as well as handling related onboarding and offboarding matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All facets of fund formation and capital development, including launching new investor-facing products, updating existing fund documents, preparing and reviewing side letters, maintaining fund side letter logs, negotiating placement agent agreements, and assisting with investor queries and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to spearhead strategic transactions, private equity transactions, loan documents and regulatory matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with our stakeholders in other departments in furtherance of the above goals, including the Firm’s CEO/CIO, COO and CFO, as well as the strategy heads, business development teams and our capital development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working collaboratively with outside counsel and other advisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A J.D. from an accredited law school and admittance to a state bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4-6 years of experience in the investment management/funds practice area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house experience is preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior legal analytical and drafting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior organization, communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and handle urgent competing workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work both independently and collaboratively in a demanding, fast-paced and fluid environment while maintaining superior rigor and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trust and maintain positive working relationships with internal and external stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest or experience in identifying and implementing AI tools to assist the legal team more broadly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who we are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Culture&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay for this role is expected to be between $200,000 and $250,000. The expected base pay range is based on information at the time this post was generated. This role will also be eligible for other forms of compensation, such as a substantive performance bonus and a competitive benefits package. Actual compensation for the successful candidate will be determined based on a variety of factors, such as skills, qualifications, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;

49b0f473-b9ff-4671-b0db-19173e1e2985:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking to hire an exceptional Compliance Officer to join our Hong Kong office. This role will report into the Head of Compliance, APAC, based in Hong Kong, and hold several responsibilities for the Hong Kong office, the APAC region in the Global markets advisory space, and the Compliance department.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requies a focus on high levels of service and technical expertise. It requires a blend of regulatory, investment and markets compliance knowledge and expertise, coupled with outstanding collaboration qualities. This role necessitates a flexibility to also support the wider compliance department with activities outside of the listed responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage APAC Control Room activities, including wall crosses, market soundings, MNPI and confidential information controls, and maintenance of the restricted list.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with broader compliance teams and various departments to assist with SFC filings, internal inquiries etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and enhance the internal compliance policy and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in conducting routine internal compliance monitoring and reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and support regulatory change initiatives connected to relevant market structure and investments in Hong Kong.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an integral and collaborative member of the APAC compliance team, Global Markets Compliance team and broader Compliance department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years’ relevant experience,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly self-motivated, organized, and attentive to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, methodical and consistent in execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and open to change, a natural problem solver and lateral thinker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with technology, systems and process orientated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm and concise communicator, collaborative and able to engage well with staff of varying roles and seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firm and team first in thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d love if you had:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SFC filings and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in maintaining control room restrictions and approving various deals for multiple investment teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Succeeded in global matrix organizational structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management skills, and experience working with Confluence, JIRA and various AI models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of adopting workflow management toolkits and new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the multi-manager hedge fund model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Culture&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm’s ethos is embedded in our people. ‘Talent is our strategy’ is our mantra and drives how we approach all initiatives at the firm. We believe our success is because of our people, so putting our talent above all else is our top priority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schonfeld strives to create an environment where our people can thrive. We foster a teamwork-oriented, collaborative environment where ideas at any level are encouraged and shared. The development and advancement of our talent is honed through interactions with each other, learning &amp;amp; educational offerings, and through opportunities to make impactful contributions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schonfeld, we strive to cultivate a sense of belonging throughout all of our employees with Diversity, Equity and Inclusion at the forefront of this mission. As a firm we are committed to creating a hiring process which is not only fair, but also welcoming and supportive. On a daily basis, our employees welcome diversity across identity, thought, people and views which serves as the foundation of our culture and success. You can learn more about our DEI initiatives here - &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/schonfeld-group/life/d53089e7-ba0e-4946-a70c-f47f0d548370/?viewAsMember=true&quot;&gt;Belonging @ Schonfeld.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who we are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schonfeld Strategic Advisors is a multi-manager platform that invests its capital with Internal and Partner portfolio managers, primarily on an exclusive or semi-exclusive basis, across four trading strategies; quantitative, fundamental equity, tactical trading and discretionary macro &amp;amp; fixed income. We have created a unique structure to provide global portfolio managers with autonomy, flexibility and support to best enable them to maximize the value of their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last 30 years, Schonfeld has successfully capitalized on inefficiencies and opportunities within the&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;markets. We have developed and invested heavily in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics and continue to capitalize on new opportunities. In 2021 we launched our newest strategy, discretionary macro &amp;amp; fixed income as part of the continual growth of Schonfeld’s investible universe. Our portfolio exposure has expanded across the Americas, Europe and Asia as well as multiple asset classes and products&lt;em&gt;. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DC1&lt;/p&gt;

e1229e7afc0d2d102fb73865398a4c9f95cd852a:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $228.7 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 31 March 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Profile Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will provide extensive secretarial and administrative support&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;This role would suit an experienced PA/EA with excellent all-round skills and an eye for detail who takes pride in providing the upmost service to the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting 2/3 Sales Heads as well as providing support and cover to President EA and wider cover for London based Sales Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a 12-month maternity leave cover with the potential of becoming a permanent position alongside the returning employee.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Office requirement: 4 days per week.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full EA/PA support including extensive diary management to organise meetings and conference calls, booking rooms, catering and VC/AV equipment if required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordination of business trips – organising tickets, accommodation, taxis, visas, meetings/itineraries, and subsequent expenses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process detailed travel expenses / credit card reconciliations and Star Compliance entries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client liaison –&amp;nbsp; including meeting scheduling, dinner arrangements and some travel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous experience as a Personal Assistant / Executive Assistant to senior management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent organisational skills and ability to prioritise competing demands, multi-task and service multiple managers/stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team player&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovative, creative, resourceful, resilient and a self-starter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High levels of discretion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IT literate and highly proficient user of MS Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and Outlook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
